title: QML verify (FlatGeobuf/GPKG)
base: 地理院タイル 淡色地図 | https://cyberjapandata.gsi.go.jp/xyz/pale/{z}/{x}/{y}.png | maxZoom=18 | minZoom=5
fgb: notrim_ref | canvas_data/trim_line.fgb | on | style=canvas_data/notrim_line.qml
fgb: trim_line | canvas_data/trim_line.fgb | on | style=canvas_data/trim_line.qml
fgb: dash_line | canvas_data/dash_line.fgb | on | style=canvas_data/dash_line.qml
fgb: glow_line | canvas_data/glow_line.fgb | on | style=canvas_data/glow_line.qml
fgb: width_test | canvas_data/width_test.fgb | on | style=canvas_data/width_test.qml
fgb: style_test | canvas_data/style_test.fgb | on | style=canvas_data/style_test.qml
fgb: fill_test | canvas_data/fill_test.fgb | on | style=canvas_data/fill_test.qml
fgb: label_test | canvas_data/label_test.fgb | on | style=canvas_data/label_test.qml
gpkg: width_gpkg | canvas_data/width_test.gpkg | on | table=width_test | style=canvas_data/width_test.qml
cam: 東京 | 35.61 | 139.65 | h=25000 | p=-90
